      "description": "THE utilization metric. DCGM_FI_PROF_GR_ENGINE_ACTIVE is the ratio of time the graphics/compute engine was active, exported 0-1, so it is multiplied by 100 here. Unlike DCGM_FI_DEV_GPU_UTIL this is a profiling-API field, which is why it survives MIG mode. Requires the exporter to run with --cap-add SYS_ADMIN and a counters file that includes DCGM_FI_PROF_* fields; if this panel is empty, that exporter change has not been applied on that host yet. Whether it resolves per MIG partition (GPU_I_ID=1/2) or only per physical GPU depends on driver support - check the legend.",
